  // Every Entra role under the framework and the tier it activates under. The inline settings are the few deliberate exceptions.
  // EasyPIM finds a role by display name; a tenant can still carry a former one (Azure AD Joined Device Local Administrator). The resolved config of step 2 uses the names THIS tenant has.
